  "row_use": "After Root's actual metadata validation, a row [s,a,p,v,t] supplies exactly {slot:s,actuator:a,q:p,dq:v,tau:t} to simulation.motor_sensors. Preserve the given row order. Do not sort by actuator or joint name. Actual driver checks ordered actuator IDs and named scalar sensors; it does not use unproved positional sensor offsets.",
